# Quest for Ancient Secrets: "Whenever a card is put into your graveyard from anywhere, you may put a quest counter on
# this enchantment." Bot1 casts Thought Scour on itself: two cards are milled from its library and then the spell itself
# lands in its graveyard, three cards and three triggers (CR 603.2c, each card its own event), and the third is declined
# ("you may"). Thought Scour on Bot2 mills two of Bot2's cards, which are no cards put into Bot1's graveyard, and then the
# spell lands in Bot1's graveyard: one trigger, accepted. Counters: 2 + 1 = 3. Counting Bot2's milled cards would make 5,
# accepting the declined one 4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Quest for Ancient Secrets
Thought Scour
Thought Scour
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x21

