Bot1.Hand.Quest for Ancient Secrets.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thought Scour.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Decline
Bot1.Accept
? Bot1.Battlefield.Quest for Ancient Secrets.Counters.Quest = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thought Scour.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Accept
[Bot1.Main2]

